&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/mission&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;mission&lt;/a&gt; at Greenhouse is to make hiring fair and simple for everyone, and that starts with how we build our own team. Here you will work with people who plan together, include each other and are open about what they do and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come and do work you are proud of, on problems that matter, with colleagues you learn from.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Greenhouse is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Success Manager, Mid-Market&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good hiring touches every part of a company and often means changing how it works. Our Customer Success Managers help customers make that change and get more from the way they recruit. The job is less about keeping in touch and more about learning what each customer wants to achieve, then using product knowledge and AI-assisted workflows to get them there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will love this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proud advocate&lt;/strong&gt; – you speak up for customers and stay kind, quick, creative and effective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An inventor&lt;/strong&gt; – you build your own AI workflows and automations to cut routine work and free time for strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A decisive operator&lt;/strong&gt; – you decide well with the facts at hand and own the result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A courageous communicator&lt;/strong&gt; – you give honest feedback and take on hard pricing and product talks directly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A trusted subject matter specialist&lt;/strong&gt; – you know the product in depth and find good answers for each customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An excellent teammate&lt;/strong&gt; – you mind the details, keep the big picture, and bring ideas that improve how we work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look after a portfolio of mid-market customers, show them the value of Greenhouse and protect gross and net revenue retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find out what each customer is aiming for and turn it into results you deliver and check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-assisted workflows that cut admin and let you serve more customers well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide which products and features matter most to each account in a busy, competitive market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer needs to our Support, Product, Engineering and Sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Account Managers across the customer lifecycle to prevent churn, find growth and secure renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Implementation Strategists so new customers launch smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other projects as the business needs them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in account management or customer success, ideally in B2B tech/SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of meeting or beating gross revenue retention targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real AI skills – you have built and refined AI workflows or automations yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear writing and presenting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, solution-minded handling of objections, pricing ones included&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to balance competing priorities across many accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in HR or recruiting technology, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your own unique talents! Skills you picked up elsewhere often carry over in ways a job ad cannot list, and we value that. If you meet most but not all of the points above, please apply anyway&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States on a full-time basis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The national pay range for this role is $72,200- $100,000. Actual pay depends on experience and qualifications. Some roles also include stock options, bonuses, merit increases or sales commission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits include medical, dental and vision insurance, life insurance, mental health support, financial wellness help and fully paid parental leave. US employees also get disability cover, a 401(k) with company match, up to 14 paid holidays a year and up to 80 hours of paid sick leave; vacation is accrued or flexible depending on the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/interviewing-at-greenhouse&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our own product&lt;/a&gt;, so we feel what our customers feel. We use AI tools carefully to change how we work while keeping people at the centre. We are remote-first, with shared offices in New York City and Ireland and co-working spaces for those who want them. Regular reviews give clear feedback and our bonus scheme rewards strong results. We believe a mix of perspectives makes us better, and we support employee resource groups and leaders who keep our culture open to everyone. Our culture has been recognised by several&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/awards&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;workplace awards&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Greenhouse Software is an equal opportunity employer. Every qualified applicant is considered regardless of race, colour, religion, sex (including pregnancy, sexual orientation or gender identity), national origin, age, disability, genetic information, veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law. If you need help or an adjustment during the application, write to kontakt@example.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We only ever contact candidates from company email addresses. See &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/candidate-phishing-scams&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;this page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; if a message looks suspicious.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/mission&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;mission&lt;/a&gt; at Greenhouse is to make hiring fair and simple for everyone, and that starts with how we build our own team. Here you will work with people who plan together, include each other and are open about what they do and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come and do work you are proud of, on problems that matter, with colleagues you learn from.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Greenhouse is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;GTM&amp;nbsp;Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Revenue Operations team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will work with the Senior Manager, Revenue Operations to connect engineering and business needs, turning requirements into software that makes the whole Customer Growth &amp;amp; Success (CGS) organisation more productive. You will help design, build and grow internal web apps used by several teams, and you will develop, deploy and maintain AI-enabled internal tools. The first project is a workflow and insights platform for every GTM team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will love this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Builder &lt;/strong&gt;- You like small teams, real ownership, quick delivery and the freedom to choose what to build and how, with modern AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Internal Advisor&lt;/strong&gt; - You enjoy working with revenue leaders, clarifying fuzzy requests and recommending what to build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Problem Solver &lt;/strong&gt;- Hard problems motivate you, and you like shipping features that remove friction right away&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An AI Enthusiast&lt;/strong&gt; - You love AI-assisted development and use tools like Claude Code to build things your team uses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and extend features in our internal web app on Next.js, TypeScript, Supabase and Vercel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reliable data pipelines and integrations between Salesforce, Gong and other revenue tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Customer Growth &amp;amp; Success (CGS) colleagues in SDR, AE, AM and CSM teams to turn their pain points into a roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and tune LLM prompts, open source AI frameworks and third-party tools so their output is accurate and useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write down architecture decisions and runbooks so others can maintain what you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check in with data engineering, security and Enterprise Apps so internal tools fit the wider company setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a Revenue Engineering role or a very technical Revenue Operations role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal revenue and CGS tools with AI assistants (i.e. Claude Code, ChatGPT, Cursor, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development in a modern stack (i.e. Python, Node.js, Next.js, Typescript, React, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development and integration work inside Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backend-as-a-service (BaaS) and modern hosting (i.e. Supabase, Firebase, AWS Amplify, Vercel, Railway, Render)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication, including explaining technical solutions to non-technical colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API integration work with tools like Gong and/or Outreach, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-growing B2B SaaS company, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Your own unique talents! Skills you picked up elsewhere often carry over in ways a job ad cannot list, and we value that. If you meet most but not all of the points above, please apply anyway&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicants must be legally eligible to work in Canada as of the start date chosen by the Company. We are unable to support sponsorship at this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Personal information you share may be processed by our affiliates in the United States or elsewhere, and by service providers such as payroll and IT vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The national pay range for this role is $117,500 - $176,300 CAD. Actual pay depends on experience and qualifications. Some roles also include stock options, bonuses, merit increases or sales commission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
